# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          <- 50 chars or so, imperative mood
#
# <body: why, not what. wrap at 72.>
#
# types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scopes used here: buttons leds display accel console ci docs hal
#
# examples:
#   feat(buttons): add HC165 bit-bang read
#   fix(accel): set auto-increment bit on multi-byte reads
#   chore(ci): pin espressif32 platform version
